### Step 3: Health Endpoints

Every service must expose a `/health` endpoint:

| Stack | Endpoint | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Java (Dropwizard) | `localhost:10081/healthcheck` | Built-in |
| Java (Spring Boot) | `localhost:8080/actuator/health` | Enable in `application.yml` |
| Python (FastAPI) | `localhost:8000/health` | Add `@app.get("/health")` |
| Go | `localhost:8080/health` | JSON handler with `{"status":"ok","timestamp":...}` |

