### Constraints

- App must run in Docker via `docker compose` — never as a bare process
- Logs to stdout as JSON — never to files
- All Docker images from `jfrog.fkinternal.com` — never Docker Hub
- Do not add observability to generated code, migrations, or vendor directories
- If health endpoints already exist, document them — do not duplicate
- `boot.sh` must call `check-prereq.sh` as its first action
- Vector `command: ["--config", "/etc/vector/vector.toml"]` is mandatory in docker-compose
